# Integration test artifacts (manifest, per-scenario logs, captured state)
/tests/integration/results/

# Generated by `make test-inventory` — regenerate on demand, don't commit (it was a merge-conflict
# surface on every concurrent PR; #414). tests/inventory.sh is the committed, deterministic source.
/docs/dev/test-inventory.md

